27	+   *
28	+   * @param snapshotDir full path of the directory where snapshots are taken.
29	+   * @param fromSnapshotName snapshot name of the from point. Null indicates the current tree.
30	+   * @param toSnapshotName snapshot name of the to point. Null indicates the current tree.
31	+   * @param snapshotDiffStartPath path relative to the snapshottable root directory from where
32	+   *     the snapshotdiff computation needs to start.
33	+   * @param snapshotDiffIndex index in the created or deleted list of the directory at which the
34	+   *     snapshotdiff computation stopped during the last rpc call. -1 indicates the diff
35	+   *     computation needs to start right from the start path.
36	+   * @return the difference report represented as a {@link SnapshotDiffReportListing}.
37	+   * @throws IOException if an I/O error occurred.
38	+   */
